WEBVTT

00:05.880 --> 00:10.000
Eldest Brother... Chu Huan protected us with his life when we fled south together!

00:10.240 --> 00:15.000
In all these years, I have never once begged anything of you.

00:16.240 --> 00:19.500
I implore you: spare our lives this once!

00:22.000 --> 00:26.500
Eldest Brother... Prince of Ning!
